<title>USA: SCPIE Holdings Inc sets qtly dividend.</title>
<headline>SCPIE Holdings Inc sets qtly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BEVERLY HILLS, Calif. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>SCPIE Holdings Inc said on Wednesday it declared a quarterly dividend of $0.05 per share, the company's first after going public.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable March 31 1997 to shareholders of record March 17 1997.</p>
<p>SCPIE Holdings, providers of medical malpractice insurance, completed an initial public offering of 2.3 million shares of its common stock at $18.25 per share on January 30 1997.</p>
</text>
